'''S.C. Kafr Qasim''' ({{langx|ar|النادي الرياضي كفر قاسم صهيب}}, ''Ālnādī Ālrīyāḍī Kafr Qāsim Ṣohayb'', {{langx|he|מועדון ספורט כפר קאסם סוהיב}}, ''Moadon Sport Kafr Qasim Sohib'', {{lit|Kafr Qasim Sohaib Sport Club}}; or in short {{langx|he|מ.ס. כפר קאסם}}, ''Mem Samekh Kafr Qasim'', {{lit|S.C. Kafr Qasim}}) is an Israeli [[Association football|football]] club based in [[Kafr Qasim]]. The club currently plays in [[Liga Leumit]], they play home matches at the [[Bat Yam Municipal Stadium]] in [[Bat Yam]]."}}
